  {
    "episode_id": 76735,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/6/76735.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 9,
    "turn_text": "Yeah, well, I think probably the folks in the admin are kind of panicking. There's a lot of confusion. They're probably getting a lot of signals from different places. I think, ironically, Biden, for all his incapacity, has actually done a pretty good job of staying on message to the best of his ability, which is he hasn't kind of deviated at all about, hey, I'm not going anywhere.",
