    "turn_text": "Jeremy Carl, and he focuses his research on multiculturalism and race relations. So it must be fascinating conferences that you get to go to at the race relation, multiculturalism booth that you hang out at. And I'm sure you get to meet a lot of interesting people. But in all seriousness, you're out with this very hot book right now, the unprotected class, how anti-white racism is tearing America apart. What is your layout, your fundamental critique of the system that is destructive and divisive right now?",
